# Nhung gi KHONG duoc gui len may dung anh Docker.
#
# Dockerfile chi COPY pom.xml va src/, nen khong co gi trong so nay tung lot vao
# anh. Van chan o day vi hai le: build context duoc nen va gui di nguyen ven
# truoc khi Dockerfile chay, nen `uploads/` hang chuc MB la hang chuc MB gui
# thua moi lan trien khai; va mot dong COPY rong tay trong tuong lai khong nen
# la thu quyet dinh `.env` co nam trong anh hay khong.

# Bi mat
.env
*.env
!.env.example

# File nguoi dung tai len / audio TTS
uploads/

# Ket qua bien dich - anh tu build lai tu dau
target/

# Cong cu
.git/
.gitignore
.idea/
*.iml
HELP.md
